<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's bank profits up.</title>
<headline>Morocco's bank profits up.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Credit du Maroc said on Wednesday it had posted net profits of 162.5 million dirhams ($17.6 million) in 1996 from 136.6 million dirhams the year before.</p>
<p>The bank, in which France's Credit Lyonnais has a 43.2 percent stake, said turnover for 1996 was 1.06 billion dirhams. No comparative figure was available for 1995.</p>
<p>The stock traded at 445 dirhams on Tuesday.</p>
<p>($ = 9.2 dirhams)</p>
</text>
